      "id": "classic_00962",
      "title": "The Duel",
      "author": "Eugene Field",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "theme": "The Gingham Dog and the Calico Cat",
      "category": "Joy & Whimsy",
      "poem_stanzas": [
        "The gingham dog and the calico cat\nSide by side on the table sat;\n'Twas half-past twelve, and (what do you think!)\nNor one nor t'other had slept a wink!\nThe old Dutch clock and the Chinese plate\nAppeared to know as sure as fate\nThere was going to be a terrible spat."
