      "id": "classic_00964",
      "title": "The Sleeper",
      "author": "Edgar Allan Poe",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "theme": "At Midnight, in the Month of June",
      "category": "Spirituality & Mystery",
      "poem_stanzas": [
        "At midnight, in the month of June,\nI stand beneath the mystic moon.\nAn opiate vapour, dewy, dim,\nExhales from out her golden rim,\nAnd, softly dripping, drop by drop,\nUpon the quiet mountain top,\nSteals drowsily and musically\nInto the universal valley."
      ],
